    "title": "🎁 Free Items Up for Grabs Around Chesterfield Today",
    "text": "7 hours ago Freebies are popping up all over Chesterfield, VA this week. Here are a few useful items your neighbors are offering at no cost.\nSeed Spreader (STA-Green 4500) Item: Seed spreader (STA-Green 4500)\nUse: For lawn fertilizer, weed & insect control, grass seed, and ice melt\nCondition: Works with no issues, described as in great shape\nLocation: Riddle, Chesterfield, VA\nSource: nextdoor.com\nIf you’re caring for your yard or need help spreading ice melt in winter, this spreader could save you time and money. The current owner simply doesn’t need it anymore and would like it to go to someone who can use it.\n👉 See this item on nextdoor.com\nGlass Doors For Tub Item: Sliding glass doors for bathtub with rails\nLocation: The Highlands, Chesterfield, VA\nSource: nextdoor.com\nDimensions:\nEach door: 54 1/2\" H x 29\" W Top rail: 55 7/8\" Bottom rail: 53 3/4\" Two side rails: 54 3/4\" each Good for a bathroom update if your tub size matches these measurements. Be sure to double-check your tub opening and height before arranging pickup.\n👉 See this item on nextdoor.com",
